  rl.1 Raul Aguilar|adult husband|Met as adults in 1990, married in 1992; traveling together as spouses.
  rl.2 Teresa Mendez|mother|Came to the United States with Leticia in 1974; last correspondence predates current travel.
  rl.3 Lucia Mendez|grandmother, died 1988|The handkerchief's original owner; matching initials enabled Leticia's private excuse.
  rl.4 Berta Salas|adult former coworker|Helped Leticia at the mill; dismissed after Leticia reported her sleeping on shift.
  rl.5 Jorge Lara|adult worker's brother|Intended recipient of the undelivered message about Simon; current whereabouts unknown.
